The '''Stubba''' is a compact [[Grineer]] submachine gun with a medium fire rate and a good magazine size. Its reliance on {{D|Slash}} and {{D|Impact}} as its main damage sources allows bleeding and stunning, with help from its good critical stats.

==Characteristics==
*This weapon deals primarily {{D|Slash}} damage.

{{Advantages|}}

{{Disadvantages|
*Fairly low ammo economy.
*Noticeable recoil, which can throw off precision aiming.
}}

{{WeaponComparison|Kuva Twin Stubbas}}
{{Clr}}
{{Acquisition|The Stubba's blueprint can be acquired as a reward from performing special Ghoul Purge [[Bounties]] or dropped by [[Ghoul Rictus|Ghoul Rictus Alphas]]. It can also be bought from the [[Market]] individually, or as part of the [[Maggor Assault Pack]].}}
{{BuildAutomatic|type=Weapon}}

==Notes==
*When the weapon is emptied to around 25% of the maximum capacity, it emits a whine that rises in pitch until depleted.

==Trivia==
*The Stubba was called the '''Grineer Uzi''' during its [[TennoCon|TennoCon 2017]] reveal.
**The ''[[wikipedia:Uzi|Uzi]]'' is a compact Israeli sub-machine gun which fills a similar role to the Stubba and can be seen as its real-life counterpart.
*The Grineer script on the ammo fuel cell reads " 2 1TA".

