{{Codex|A classic shotgun design, embellished for the elite as only the Orokin could.}}
'''Strun Prime''' is the [[Prime|Primed]] variant of the {{Weapon|Strun}}. In addition to being a direct upgrade, it has gained innate [[punch through]] and longer damage falloff range, but at the expense of slower [[reload speed]]. It was released alongside {{WF|Nidus Prime}} and {{Weapon|Magnus Prime}}.

==Characteristics==
*This weapon deals primarily {{D|Impact}} and {{D|Slash}} damage.
*Reloads one shell at a time at a rate of 0.4 seconds per shell, which can be interrupted at any point, allowing for planned reloading.
**Reloading has a total 0.6 second delay to start and end.
**Individual shell reload causes magazine increasing effects to increase total reload time.

{{Advantages|class=Shotgun|
*Innate 0.8 meter [[punch through]].
*The linear damage falloff is further away than most shotguns: from 100% to 50% from 26m to 52m target distance (distances are affected by [[Projectile Speed]]).
}}
{{Disadvantages|class=Shotgun|}}
