==Tips==
*Because of the need to reload the magazine one shot at a time, the Strun Prime has an extremely slow reload speed before reaching maximum ammo capacity. It can therefore benefit from things that help economize its loaded ammo such as {{A|Energized Munitions}}, or those that bypass its reloading mechanism such as from {{WF|Garuda}}'s {{A|Bloodletting}} with the {{M|Blood Forge}} augment, to maintain the weapon's otherwise generally high overall DPS output potential.
